{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/90e02fe8a7369cd9e5ba8437d0745953.avif?t=1772744162\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the only survivor of a fallen noble family, you enter the Empire's most dangerous court with one goal in mind: Stay hidden. Uncover the truth. Get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The court will try to break you, and the men behind the princely masks are not who they seem.  Some are more dangerous than you imagined, and some are more human than you expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not going to let love get in the way, are you? You came here for answers, not to lose yourself in a game you weren't supposed to be playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/be46b43e4824b7f25a806a52201b69eb.avif?t=1772744162\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOVE INTERESTS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Maximilian Windrake (The Crimson Reaper)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/35d6972b332a79e6dc6b1c91cebf4929.poster.avif?t=1772744162\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/35d6972b332a79e6dc6b1c91cebf4929.webm?t=1772744162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/35d6972b332a79e6dc6b1c91cebf4929.mp4?t=1772744162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory after territory fell beneath this fearsome general. The war may be over, but he cannot lay down his armor. He does not converse. He commands. Will you crumble under his cold judgment, or conquer the conqueror?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lucian Windrake (The Enigmatic Enchanter)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/1f04ebba93996b77703c13b131fc5016.poster.avif?t=1772744162\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/1f04ebba93996b77703c13b131fc5016.webm?t=1772744162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/1f04ebba93996b77703c13b131fc5016.mp4?t=1772744162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beloved by all. Suspicious to anyone paying attention. He seems to know everything, appears everywhere, and asks the questions you can't afford to answer. Can you outsmart his mind games, or will you willingly walk into his cage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIDE CHARACTERS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Victoria Rosemoore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/6f6670d28769cd6ce85a23f4e8090bf7.avif?t=1772744162\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If perfection exists, she is it. As the betrothed of the crown prince, she doesn't just get what she wants; she eliminates what she doesn't. Right now, her attention is focused on the one thing she didn't anticipate: you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nerissa Valeine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/27b146a37125d49fd0a2b717b853654b.avif?t=1772744162\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wears silk and jewels and says very little. In this palace, that means she knows everything. She will warn you of the dangers. Repeatedly. You would be wise to listen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Amelia Windrake</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/dfe3d2e67b4606cd7b785606d703dd5a.avif?t=1772744162\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is five years old and entirely too good for this palace. Your job is to protect her. But in such a treacherous court, can any child remain unscathed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/e8c67620f2f85271f00c0d76fb90b5cd.avif?t=1772744162\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661\u00a0<strong>Customizable Heroine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't just choose your name, the choices you make will shape your personality and determine how the story unfolds.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2661\u00a0<strong>Two Unique Routes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two distinct storylines, each hiding secrets the other won't reveal. You'll need to explore both to see the full picture.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 8+ Endings</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A happily ever after is not guaranteed. Guillotine, regicide, and revolution are only some of the possible endings. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 Spicy Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The princes are very composed in public. They are considerably less composed in private. You didn't hear that from us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 Animated characters &amp; CGs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn't always say  what he\u2019s thinking. But watch the way he frowns when you utter the wrong name.  The clues are there. Don\u2019t blink, you might just miss one.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552020?t=1772744162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552020?t=1772744162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/583bbde9d763ff31fb0cdb5eae212fec60acc30e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772744162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/583bbde9d763ff31fb0cdb5eae212fec60acc30e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772744162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Fate's Masquerade contains mature themes, and player discretion is advised. These include but are not limited to violence, blood, murder, human death, animal death, strong language, alcohol references, and sexual references. \r\n"},"demos":[{"appid":3552060,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/90e02fe8a7369cd9e5ba8437d0745953.avif?t=1772744162\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the only survivor of a fallen noble family, you enter the Empire's most dangerous court with one goal in mind: Stay hidden. Uncover the truth. Get out alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The court will try to break you, and the men behind the princely masks are not who they seem.  Some are more dangerous than you imagined, and some are more human than you expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not going to let love get in the way, are you? You came here for answers, not to lose yourself in a game you weren't supposed to be playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/be46b43e4824b7f25a806a52201b69eb.avif?t=1772744162\" width=1560 height=195 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>LOVE INTERESTS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Maximilian Windrake (The Crimson Reaper)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/35d6972b332a79e6dc6b1c91cebf4929.poster.avif?t=1772744162\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/35d6972b332a79e6dc6b1c91cebf4929.webm?t=1772744162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/35d6972b332a79e6dc6b1c91cebf4929.mp4?t=1772744162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Territory after territory fell beneath this fearsome general. The war may be over, but he cannot lay down his armor. He does not converse. He commands. Will you crumble under his cold judgment, or conquer the conqueror?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Lucian Windrake (The Enigmatic Enchanter)</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/1f04ebba93996b77703c13b131fc5016.poster.avif?t=1772744162\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/1f04ebba93996b77703c13b131fc5016.webm?t=1772744162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/1f04ebba93996b77703c13b131fc5016.mp4?t=1772744162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beloved by all. Suspicious to anyone paying attention. He seems to know everything, appears everywhere, and asks the questions you can't afford to answer. Can you outsmart his mind games, or will you willingly walk into his cage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SIDE CHARACTERS</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Victoria Rosemoore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/extras/6f6670d28769cd6ce85a23f4e8090bf7.avif?t=1772744162\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If perfection exists, she is it. As the betrothed of the crown prince, she doesn't just get what she wants; she eliminates what she doesn't. Right now, her attention is focused on the one thing she didn't anticipate: you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Nerissa Valeine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img clas