 >The princes are very composed in public. They are considerably less composed in private. You didn't hear that from us.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2661 Animated characters &amp; CGs</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He doesn't always say  what he\u2019s thinking. But watch the way he frowns when you utter the wrong name.  The clues are there. Don\u2019t blink, you might just miss one.</p>","developers":["Small Serenity Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552020/a9acfe86d7b155670d9535e88b8ef81c69280ee7/header.jpg?t=1772744162","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel-compatible (Apple silicon supported through Rosetta 2)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552020/2057993015/f8865912c025f591d73c2dd8fa378e7ba613001f/1755071741/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755098126","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552020/2057993015/f8865912c025f591d73c2dd8fa378e7ba613001f/1755071741/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755098126","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3552020/2057993015/f8865912c025f591d73c2dd8fa378e7ba613001f/1755071741/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755098126","id":257182483,"name":"FM trailer 2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182483/cb0768fd69d66983dc7b465005e516b55ff79943/movie_600x337.jpg?t=175509812